OL,3,APhilippine police obtain warrant to
OL,4,Asearch Thomas Markle's devices
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour boxes of material, including
OL,7,Fcomputers, phones, hard drives and old
OL,8,Fvideotapes, were handed to police by
OL,9,FMeghan Markle's half-brother, Thomas
OL,10,FMarkle Jr., last week. However,
OL,11,Fofficers in Cebu needed a court warrant
OL,12,Fbefore they could examine the items.
OL,14,FThomas Markle Sr., who is now in the
OL,15,FUS, has strongly denied the allegations
OL,16,Fmade by his son, describing them as
OL,17,F"sick lies".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
